  "term": "Turner syndrome",
  "definition": "Turner syndrome, also called Ullrich-Turner syndrome, is an endocrine disorder. In the supplied source, it is described as a condition that can negatively affect bone metabolism during puberty and adolescence, which may reduce the development of peak bone mass and increase later osteoporosis risk.",
